        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "They were very helpful to us as new boat owners this summer - definitely appreciated the family vibe that you don't find in many places anymore. We were very appreciative to find a place like them so close to home!",
        "time": 1757119091,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Thomas Madden",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109262073648111833982/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
