        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "The women working there was very very rude and knot very interested in helping me two days in a row .I bought a 200$ bilge pump need some tubing I told her the size of tube then she pulled out a tape measure and rudely told me how to use a tape measure .I have bean in construction for 40 years what a insult .plus hoo buys a bilge pump in December ? She should have bean happy for the sale . Plus that knot the first time she bean like that with me.and others .I miss the last owner  he was the polar opposite . It a great store very good prices .but I did find the same pump on line for 65$ .but I needed it ASAP",
        "time": 1639956518,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Raymond Burelle",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104945663823291636421/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXqapDkWRBbuuw9ndgk2d7T7xLIXqx3tIRXsym6CUkYDYK3yNTz=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 years ago",
        "text": "I went into the store in montreal to find a style of seat for my boat even though the staff knew I wasnt purchasing anything that day they were very helpful when it came time to order I ordered them online they were fast and efficient with delivery even during covid-19 restrictions. They answered all my questions and let me try many seats before settling on the 2 buckets I wanted .",
